Step 1: Docker Hub Access Token Generation

1.Navigate to Docker Hub → Account Settings → Security → Personal access tokens.

2.Click New Access Token.

3.Set description to github-actions-ci and assign Read & Write permissions.

4.Copy the generated token string (dckr_pat_...).

Step 2: Configure Repository Secrets on 

1.In your GitHub repository, navigate to Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions.

2.Under Repository secrets, add:

DOCKER_USERNAME: Your Docker Hub username.

DOCKER_PASSWORD: Your Docker Hub Personal Access Token.

Step 3: Complete Workflow Configuration
File: .github/workflows/pipeline.yml

name: Build, Test, and Containerize

on:
  push:
    branches: [ "main" ]
  pull_request:
    branches: [ "main" ]

jobs:
  # JOB 1: Continuous Integration (Test)
  unit-tests:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout Code
        uses: actions/checkout@v4.2.2

      - name: Set up Python
        uses: actions/setup-python@v5.4.0
        with:
          python-version: '3.11'

      - name: Install Dependencies
        run: |
          python -m pip install --upgrade pip
          pip install -r requirements.txt

      - name: Run Pytest Suite
        run: |
          python -m pytest

  # JOB 2: Continuous Delivery (Build and Publish to Docker Hub)
  build-and-package:
    needs: unit-tests
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    if: github.ref == 'refs/heads/main' && github.event_name == 'push'

    steps:
      - name: Checkout Code
        uses: actions/checkout@v4.2.2

      - name: Set up Docker Buildx
        uses: docker/setup-buildx-action@v3.10.0

      - name: Log in to Docker Hub
        uses: docker/login-action@v3
        with:
          username: ${{ secrets.DOCKER_USERNAME }}
          password: ${{ secrets.DOCKER_PASSWORD }}

      - name: Build and Push Docker Image
        uses: docker/build-push-action@v5
        with:
          context: .
          push: true
          tags: |
            ${{ secrets.DOCKER_USERNAME }}/devops-flask-app:latest
            ${{ secrets.DOCKER_USERNAME }}/devops-flask-app:${{ github.sha }}



            